{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1419164-metis-by-inter-fera-parentage","id":1419164,"title":"Metis by inter-fera parentage?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-20T08:05:59-07:00","id":1419164,"title":"Metis by inter-fera parentage?","content":"In some German forum the question came up and I'm fairly certain, that Kitsune/Bastet-sex wouldn't produce a Metis for they aren't the same species. But is there an actual text reference to that?<br /> <br /> In either W20 or revised and pre-revised books ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T12:43:12-07:00","id":1419203,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t know, i don\u2019t think they\u2019ll be able to reproduce, but then let\u2019s just say there child counts as kinfolk to only one of the parents. Like a flip of the coin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T13:01:02-07:00","id":1419205,"title":"","content":"Why wouldn't they be able to reproduce in homid form (both are homid breed, I'd guess)?<br /> And why would the 10% chance of breeding true (not factoring in talens from Hammer&amp;Klaive and pure breed according to Kinfolk:Unsung Heroes, since none of them is kin) be invalid?<br /> IMO, the child could be Kitsune, Bastet, Kitsune-Kin, Bastet-Kin, kin to both or human.<br /> <br /> But this post shouldn't be about guessing what it could be. For the discussion in the German forum, I was just wondering, if any of you knew a text reference to that, especially from W20 sources, which I didn't read.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T15:27:10-07:00","id":1419249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1419164-metis-by-inter-fera-parentage?p=1419205#post1419205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why wouldn't they be able to reproduce in homid form (both are homid breed, I'd guess)?<br /> And why would the 10% chance of breeding true (not factoring in talens from Hammer&amp;Klaive and pure breed according to Kinfolk:Unsung Heroes, since none of them is kin) be invalid?<br /> IMO, the child could be Kitsune, Bastet, Kitsune-Kin, Bastet-Kin, kin to both or human.<br /> <br /> But this post shouldn't be about guessing what it could be. For the discussion in the German forum, I was just wondering, if any of you knew a text reference to that, especially from W20 sources, which I didn't read.</div> </div> </div> </div>In Storyteller's Handbook revised, pages 191-192, the answer is as follows;<br /> <br /> 90% chance to be kin of EITHER breed, 5% percent chance to be a garou, 5% chance to be the other breed.<br /> <br /> It says nothing about coywolves, but given the kids ENTIRELY lose any PB they might have otherwise, I'd say its either or.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T23:32:48-07:00","id":1419315,"title":"","content":"Thanks. That is what I was looking for...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T08:42:00-07:00","id":1419379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/